Z||000007||Fast85GT||08-07-2001||01:32 PM||||I doubt that the ditributor is your problem, b/c you already had a problem before that.  Do you have a V6? You need to chech your sensors.  Sound like your MAP is possibly disconnected.  Timing can be a problem, but it does not just happen.  Did this problem just develope? Or did it happen when you were tinkering with it? You need to check your TPI and IAC valve sensors.  If you have a 4 cyl on which you can adjust mixute and idle speed, check that.<P>------------------<BR>Jeremy H<BR>Black 1985 Pontiac Fiero GT||||reg||1
